--- make
description: A library of functions in lib/ that scripts, pages, controllers and tests import
category: Scripts and data
usage: <name> [--fns greet,farewell]
--fns: The functions to write, comma separated (default one named after the file)
example: kscript make module pricing --fns subtotal,tax,total
example: kscript make module text/slugs
to: {{ paths.lib }}/{{ dir }}{{ kebab }}{{ ext }}
hint: Import it: import "{{ paths.lib }}/{{ dir }}{{ kebab }}{{ ext }}" (or "../lib/…" from a folder). Test it: kscript make test {{ kebab }}
---
// {{ title }}: functions to import, so scripts, pages and tests share one copy of the rules.

{{#each fns}}
/// {{ item | title }}.
fn {{ item | snake }}(value) {
  return $value
}

{{else}}
/// {{ title }}.
fn {{ snake }}(value) {
  return $value
}
{{/each}}
